            "review_title": "Review at MJL Food Center",
            "review_text": "John\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\n23rd November 2023\nNov 2023 • Friends\nI went here in November with some friends after a late night out and we had a phenomenal experience. The guy at the counter was available and happy to take our order, he added in drinks for free and kept asking if there was something missing. The service was excellent and so was the food as well as what you’re getting. Great place, would definitely recommend 10/10\nRead more\nWritten February 24, 2024",
