            "review_text": "thedistancekc\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam211 contributions\n1\nGreat flavours, great food!!\nMay 2017 • Couples\nRecently moved to an apartment around the corner and this place is perfect for a quick takeaway tea!!\n\nTheres plenty of choice for a kebab shop and they don't take long to make at all. \nThe prices are extremely reasonable for D2, kebab wraps & pitas are around 60k.\n\nThe chicken or beef rolls are lovely as are the crispy tacos. The burritos are full to the brim of lovely flavours. To be honest, don't think there's anything on the menu that's not nice.\n\nEverything is made to order which makes it even better. Will be a definite local for us now\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2017",
